  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norec, FK Norway, civil society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership seeks to support the EPPJC in advancing democratic norms of peaceful competition, consensus-oriented national dialogue and inclusive policies in Ethiopia. The project aims to strengthen the institutional capacity of the EPPJC to fulfil this important role. Secondly, the project will support the efforts of the EPPJC&#x2019;s Women Wing and Youth Wing to ensure that Ethiopian political parties better represent women and youth in their internal structures, processes, outreach efforts, and policy platforms ahead of general elections in 2026. A particular focus will also be placed on strengthening the regional structures of the EPPJC to ensure broad participation that comes from outside Addis Ababa. Overall, the project aims to foster sustained dialogue among Ethiopian political parties that leads to peaceful and representative electoral process.</narrative>
  </description>
